{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_222_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_222","textTraditional":"一、九年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_222_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_222","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，戊申，鄭伯蠆卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_222_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_222","textTraditional":"三、得寶玉、大弓。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_222_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_222","textTraditional":"其不地何也？寶玉、大弓在家則羞，不目羞也。惡得之？得之堤下。或曰，陽虎以解眾也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_222_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_222","textTraditional":"四、六月，葬鄭獻公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_222_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_222","textTraditional":"五、秋，齊侯、衞侯次於五氏。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_222_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_222","textTraditional":"六、秦伯卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_222_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_222","textTraditional":"七、冬，葬秦哀公。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}